     <p style="text-align:center">
</p><p style="text-indent:32px;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">春风轻拂，万物复苏，</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">3</span><span style="font-family:宋体">月</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">30</span><span style="font-family:宋体">日，我校第三届春季体测运动会圆满举行。此次运动会不仅是一次体能的较量，更是一次青春的狂欢，充分展示了同学们的活力与风采。</span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"> </span></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/4/202404031628074085.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202404031628074085.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/4/202404031629484048.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202404031629484048.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/4/202404031628114883.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202404031628114883.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/4/202404031628143211.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202404031628143211.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/4/202404031630424982.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202404031630424982.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/4/202404031628202266.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202404031628202266.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/4/202404031629290913.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202404031629290913.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/4/202404031629484806.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202404031629484806.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/4/202404031629534087.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202404031629534087.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/4/202404031629580741.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202404031629580741.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/4/202404031629586637.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202404031629586637.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/4/202404031630033050.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202404031630033050.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/4/202404031630310527.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202404031630310527.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/4/202404031630373736.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202404031630373736.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/4/202404031630364083.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202404031630364083.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/4/202404031630419204.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202404031630419204.jpg" /></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"></span>
</p><p style="text-indent:28px;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">在运动会上，同学们积极参与各项体测项目。</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">50</span><span style="font-family:宋体">米赛道上，选手们如离弦之箭，全力冲刺；立定跳远赛场上，同学们奋力一跃，挑战自我极限。同时，坐位体前屈、仰卧起坐、引体向上、长跑等体测项目场地也传来同学们此起彼伏的欢呼和加油声，大家用汗水和坚持谱写着青春的篇章。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:28px;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">体测运动会的成功举行，离不开学校老师的精心组织和辛勤付出，他们为运动会提供了有力的保障和支持，确保了比赛的顺利进行。同时，也要感谢同学们的积极参与和全力以赴，让这场运动会变得更加精彩和有意义。在未来的日子里，我校将继续弘扬体育精神，积极举办更多内容丰富的体育活动，让同学们在运动中收获健康和快乐。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:28px;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"> </span></p><table width="674" style="width: 551px;"><tbody><tr style="height:27px" class="firstRow"><td width="71" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-width: initial; border-style: none; border-color: initial;">
